Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:06.26,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1150,4100,5140)\pos(653.755,384.122)}Episode 59
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:06.26,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1150,4100,5140)\pos(653.755,574.455)}The Retreat to Màichéng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.74,0:00:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, there are ships coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the tinder!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The tinder is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:25.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6100,6420)\pos(332.8,497.6)}Lǚ Méng\NStyled: Zǐmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.86,0:01:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Order the troops in every ship on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who exposes us must be executed at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.02,0:01:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Orders from Grand Marshal Lü: be on standby, do not act rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who exposes us will be executed at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here? \NNo mooring is allowed here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we are merchants!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind and waves are fierce! \NWe'll take refuge then go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.50,0:01:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No! This beacon tower is an important place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No ship may moor here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please allow this exception!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stay for long! We'll leave after the wind and waves pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on the ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pottery and brocades, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.58,0:02:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine! Leave when the wind and waves subside! Do not stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are these-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.74,0:04:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Up! Dress up and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the 20,000 troops \Nfrom Jing Province have been organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, we can attack Fancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Order all officers to the tent for a conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:42.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(353.6,88)}Jīng Province
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It is us! Lower the drawbridge! Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the torch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the torches! Let them identify us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.06,0:06:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you identify us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're our own. Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rush into the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Close the gate! Hurry and close the gate! Lift the drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:39.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2020,2380)\pos(337.333,460)}Sūn Quán\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:01.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2270,2270)\pos(929.333,469.333)}Lù Xùn\NStyled: Bóyán
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, according to the scouts...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wu army has taken Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wu army took Jing Province so quickly because Jing Province must be empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be Guan Yu moving the troops of Jing northwards
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,to attack Fancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I believe that\N Fancheng is in even greater danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Ren is straining his neck to seek help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should write a letter about this situation and have it shot into Fancheng
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so that morale may be boosted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We should also find a way to let Guan Yu \Nknow that Eastern Wu has seized Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu would lead his troops southwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, order Xu Huang to pursue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Total victory will be guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenhe, your plan is to my liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a man to tell Xu Huang to sally forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Xu Gongming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Marquis, after years of separation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}never did I imagine seeing your hair turn white!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Remembering our time together in our prime,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I have learned much from you. \NI am thankful and will never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Gongming, you exaggerate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Marquis, your heroic might is esteemed by everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:51.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2270,2270)\pos(986.667,510.667)}Xú Huǎng\NStyled: Gōngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}and all your acquaintances \Nfeel envy when they hear of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}To have this encounter \Nmakes me overjoyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}We have a deep relationship unlike any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Yet why, at this juncture, \Ndo you threaten my son Guan Ping?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever beheads Guan Yu will \Nbe rewarded one thousand pieces of gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongming, why do you say this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our meeting on the battlefield is a state matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.98,0:11:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not abandon it for a private one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:27.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(292,476)}Zhōu Cāng
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring the bell! Ring the bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Ping, my son, come fight Xu Huang with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Liao Hua and Wang Pu, lead the rear army to fight Cao Ren!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:51.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1980,2300)\pos(314,389.333)}Guān Píng
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:14.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,At this moment, Cao Ren \Nrushed out of Fancheng with an army
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to make a pincer attack against the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:20.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The Shu army was attacked on two sides and could not fend them off,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:22.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,so they retreated to Gong'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:26.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,However, the garrison general \Nhad given the city to Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:28.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,so they retreated to Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:33.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,However, the man sent to Nan Commandery to urge for provisions had not reported back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, how is the wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General, where do you desire to go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.22,0:13:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Recuperate for now, then engage in a decisive battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Jing Province was taken by Lü Meng \Nof Eastern Wu, and your household was captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Sun Quan is already in Jing Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Can this be true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I snuck into Jing Province, {\bord14\pos(640,670)}I saw and heard it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Lü Meng's illness and Lu Xun's reassignment to guard Lukou were all ruses!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell for those villains' devious plotting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father!\N-General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to Gong'an for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:15:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, that is Provision Marshal Zhao Lei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be back from Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to Gong'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fu Shiren of Gong'an surrendered to Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1705,1705)\pos(974.667,324)}Zhào Lěi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fu Shiren then went to Nan Commandery and\N killed the man urging for provisions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.30,0:15:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He also entreated Mi Fang \Nto surrender to Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father!\N-General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Guan!\N-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Major Wang...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret not heeding your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not assigning an able man to supervise \NJing Province caused our present defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marshal Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.22,0:16:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I built beacon towers along the Yangzi river long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did they not light the fires \Nwhen the Eastern Wu troops came?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Meng had his men dress in white and \Ncross the river disguised as merchants.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He hid elite troops in the cabins and\N captured the tower guards during the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.06,0:17:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hence, the fires were not lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.78,0:17:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That underhanded brigand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-General!\N-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the nine commanderies in Jing Province...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,have all fallen into enemy hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.74,0:17:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I bear to face my elder brother now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Guan!\N-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:20.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu was forced to lead the remaining forces to Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:24.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,On the way, he was repeatedly intercepted by Wu troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:29.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He had no alternative but to move towards Maicheng to seek shelter temporarily
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:33.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,in order to wait for reinforcements \Nfrom the Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,However, they were so far, far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:38.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,they could not easily arrive in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:42.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the troops of Eastern Wu surrounded Maicheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:49.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu wrote a letter to Liu Feng and Meng Da, \Nthe guarding generals of Shangyong, to seek help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:50.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4540,4900)\pos(942.667,450.667)}Màichéng
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:20:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Western Riverlands is so far, far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,reinforcements cannot easily arrive in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot wait to die in this isolated city!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Liao.\N-Generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:20.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2820,3180)\pos(470.667,482.667)}Liào Huà\NStyled: Yuánjiǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu is trapped in Maicheng after his defeat. This is urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.98,0:20:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Aid from Shu is yet to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.06,0:20:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He ordered me to seek help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must raise troops now as reinforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Any tarry or delay,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.86,0:20:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and General Guan will fall into enemy hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:40.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2180,2540)\pos(349.333,505.333)}Mèng Dá\NStyled: Zǐqìng
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General Liao, please rest in the manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow General Meng and I to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you two will make arrangements soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aid from Shangyong should have arrived today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there no sign of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Marshal Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How are our provisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no food in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only five or six hundred people in total. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,many are wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You see General Guan as your uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.82,0:21:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but what if he does not see you as his nephew?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}I have heard that years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}when the King of Hanzhong adopted you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:22:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}General Guan was already quite displeased.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}And when the King took his throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.14,0:22:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}he thought you could be the heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.74,0:22:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}He asked Kongming, and Kongming said,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.02,0:22:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}"This is a personal matter. Ask Guan and Zhang."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}So the King sent a man to Jing Province to ask Guan Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.42,0:22:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}And the response?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Guan Yu said,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}"He is a {\u0\i1}mínglíng{\u0\i0} child and must not be made heir!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:25.70,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mínglíng{\i0} child (螟蛉): It means "foster child." It is caterpillar larvae said to be carried by the potter wasp ({\i1}guǒluǒ,{\i0} 蜾蠃) to be raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Guan Yu also urged the King to send you far away into this remote mountain city of Shangyong
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.02,0:22:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}to prevent future trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there aid?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.82,0:22:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Jin, the Chief Secretary of Eastern Wu, came to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.46,0:22:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Jin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.10,0:22:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Zhuge Jin is invited!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.34,0:23:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyu, for what purpose do you come today?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.94,0:23:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu ordered me to give you advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.02,0:23:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.10,0:23:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As old wisdom says, he who can suit his actions to the time is wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you know of your present situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.82,0:23:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And that present situation is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.86,0:23:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Today, the nine commanderies of Jing you administered all belong to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.86,0:23:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Only this petty, single, and isolated city stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With no food inside and no aid outside, it is in peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.22,0:23:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your situation is cause for concern!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.50,0:23:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What, in your opinion, should be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.78,0:24:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the Marquis of Wu is a brilliant master.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.22,0:24:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,His virtue and talent are no less than Imperial \NUncle Liu. He will soon achieve his great cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.26,0:24:06.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3100,3420)\pos(333.333,512)}Zhūgě Jǐn\NStyled: Zǐyú
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.22,0:24:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu has always admired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you are a sensible man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not join him before Maicheng is breached?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.66,0:24:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, you can reorganize \NJing and protect your household.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.34,0:24:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please consider this carefully, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.06,0:24:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}How can Sun Quan, a brigand, be on par with the King of Hanzhong, my elder brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.46,0:24:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}I am but a warrior from Xieliang
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.18,0:24:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}who happens to be treated as a brother by my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.98,0:24:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Our brotherhood has lasted over \Nthirty years since the Peach Garden Oath
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}without a bit of suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.58,0:24:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}The King of Hanzhzong has bestowed me a great task,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.34,0:24:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}and trust as heavy as mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.06,0:25:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}I am a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.02,0:25:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}How could I betray that bond to defect?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.42,0:25:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}If the city falls, then I will fall with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.78,0:25:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Jade may be shattered, but its whiteness remains;
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.50,0:25:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}bamboo may be burned, \Nbut its joints stand straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.10,0:25:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Though my body may be broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.90,0:25:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}my name shall remain!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.70,0:25:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}What is there to be afraid of!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.26,0:25:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.70,0:25:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.10,0:25:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.74,0:25:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.02,0:25:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I vow to fight against Sun Quan to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.18,0:25:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.70,0:25:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu truly has the best intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.98,0:25:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to build the Bond of {\i1}Qín{\i0} and {\i1}Jìn{\i0} with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.98,0:25:51.38,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Bond of {\i1}Qín{\i0} and {\i1}Jìn{\i0} (秦晋之好): Refers to matrimonial ties in reference to the states of {\i1}Qín{\i0}（秦） and {\i1}Jìn{\i0}（晋） of the Spring and Autumn Period.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.54,0:25:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to defeat Cao Cao and restore the Han Dynasty together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.54,0:25:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no other motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.78,0:25:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, must you be so stubborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.94,0:25:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! Do not slander my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.06,0:25:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Young general, young general...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.58,0:26:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.66,0:26:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyu's younger brother, Kongming,\Nis serving the King of Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.66,0:26:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Would killing him not hurt the Strategos' heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.42,0:26:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.38,0:26:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.82,0:26:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis! Marquis!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.46,0:26:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.78,0:26:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.18,0:26:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.46,0:26:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Send him out of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.82,0:26:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.06,0:26:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What a loyal liegeman Guan Yunchang is!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.66,0:26:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziming, what should be done in this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.06,0:26:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, the situation today is unlike \Nthe lone banquet with Guan Yu before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.82,0:26:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Even if he sprouted wings, he could not escape the trap that I deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.94,0:26:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What great plan do you have, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.30,0:26:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I reckon Guan Yu will soon be forced to abandon the city and flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.70,0:26:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if Guan Yu abandons the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.62,0:26:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Guan Yu, with so few troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.46,0:27:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}will not escape through major roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.94,0:27:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}To the north of Maicheng, there is \Nan arduous path to the Western Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.34,0:27:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Guan Yu will certainly use this path.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.62,0:27:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Have Zhu Ran lay an ambush with five thousand elite soldiers, twenty {\i1}li{\i0} to the north of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Once the enemy arrives, do not engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.38,0:27:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Follow it and attack it from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Their army will be demoralized and flee to Linju.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.66,0:27:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Have Pan Zhang lead five hundred elite soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.70,0:27:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}to lay an ambush by the \Nmountainous path near Linju.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.18,0:27:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Thus, Guan Yu will be captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.10,0:27:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Good! I will act according to your strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.42,0:27:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Order the officers to attack every gate of Maicheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.78,0:27:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}save for the northern gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.66,0:27:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}We will wait for Guan Yu to exit through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.38,0:27:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.30,0:28:38.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3000,3640)\pos(967.143,460.286)}Wáng Pǔ
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.50,0:28:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan, all the provisions in the city have been consumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.94,0:28:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There were five to six hundred soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.78,0:28:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After a count, only three hundred or so are left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.46,0:28:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret not heeding your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.42,0:29:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is critical today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What plans do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.94,0:29:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, even Jiang Ziya \Nreborn would not have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.94,0:29:12.86,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Jiāng Zǐyá (姜子牙): A strategist and minister of the Zhou Dynasty. Author of {\i1}The Six Secret Teachings{\i0} (六韜), a treatise on civil and military strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.26,0:29:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father, Father!\N-General Guan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.18,0:29:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our losses are solely my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.42,0:29:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was given immense trust by the King of Hanzhong
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.82,0:29:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,to guard Jing Province, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.66,0:30:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only repay him with death.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.38,0:30:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father!\N-General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.14,0:30:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As Guan Ping is my son, \Nhe will accompany me dead or alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.62,0:30:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You all have families, with old and young relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.62,0:30:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the city falls tonight, masquerade \Nas civilians and pursue your own courses.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.62,0:30:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, we are willing to follow you dead or alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.74,0:30:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, why say such words?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.14,0:30:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, we pledge to follow you with our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.02,0:30:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather we have our bodies and bones\N be crushed than renege on our words!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.82,0:30:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We swear to follow you \Nto fight Sun Quan to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.50,0:30:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.50,0:30:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.66,0:31:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, the absence of aid from Shangyong
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.14,0:31:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,must be due to Liu Feng and Meng Da standing down their forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.38,0:31:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Aid from Shu cannot be hoped for, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.82,0:31:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not leave this lone city, rush to the Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.74,0:31:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and reorganize the troops to plan for a counterattack?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.50,0:31:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have thought of this also.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.22,0:31:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, some enemy troops are at the northern gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.82,0:31:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the citizens,\N a small path north of the city leads to Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.06,0:31:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We will use that path tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.62,0:31:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be ambushes along it. \NWe should use the major road.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.74,0:31:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if there are ambushes, what do I have to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.46,0:31:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Orders! All military personnel, \Norganize your attire and prepare to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.82,0:31:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.70,0:32:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the troops are ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.66,0:32:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.14,0:32:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.22,0:33:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.86,0:33:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.34,0:33:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.26,0:33:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall stay with one hundred troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.90,0:33:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We will defend this city with our lives, to stall the foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.46,0:33:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We will stop them from chasing you, Marquis.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.74,0:33:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.06,0:33:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,General, is this not seeking your own demise?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.98,0:33:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have followed you for eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.62,0:33:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have learned very much and \Nmy lifelong wish has been fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.14,0:33:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will die without any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.14,0:33:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the city falls, we will not surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.38,0:33:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Wang Pu, only hope\N you will come back and save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.14,0:33:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.02,0:34:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, be vigilant and take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.98,0:34:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.70,0:34:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is short. Please mount your horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.18,0:34:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, please mount!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.46,0:34:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang, please rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.50,0:34:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Cang!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.62,0:34:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.66,0:34:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.98,0:34:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.02,0:34:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Defend this city with General Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.10,0:34:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.70,0:35:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed you for many years!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.98,0:35:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The trip to the Western Riverlands will be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.70,0:35:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot stay in the city, I must not abandon you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.26,0:35:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,With Guan Ping following, \Nnothing will go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.98,0:35:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang leads troops by himself, defending the city will be a heavy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.26,0:35:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.30,0:35:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your staying can give him a firm hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.34,0:35:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Zhou Cang, do not know when I can serve you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.90,0:36:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My good brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.82,0:36:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.70,0:36:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.98,0:37:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mount!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.98,0:37:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.14,0:38:20.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu, leading just over one hundred remaining soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.98,0:38:24.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,pushed out of the northern pass and advanced, blade in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.14,0:38:27.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After walking for about twenty {\i1}li,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.18,0:38:30.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,he was ambushed by Zhu Ran of Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.50,0:38:34.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu, unwilling to fight,\N retreated towards a small path.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.02,0:38:39.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhao Lei had already died among the army in the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.86,0:39:35.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The number of soldiers accompanying\N Guan Yu had dwindled to just over ten men.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.38,0:39:43.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,A disheartened Guan Yu ordered Guan Ping \Nto guard the rear while he opened a way in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.54,0:39:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
